# Changelog

All notable changes to Shuyi Engine are in this file, written from `tickets/done/` and the merges by `cargo xtask changelog`. The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/).

## [Unreleased]

### Added

- [Hot reload for baked assets](https://github.com/Zafnok/shuyi-engine/blob/main/tickets/done/2203-hot-reload-for-baked-assets.md) ([#41](https://github.com/Zafnok/shuyi-engine/pull/41))

### Changed

- 1 Sonar fix
- 1 dependency update

## [0.2.0] - 2026-12-01

### Added

- [Fixed-step timers](https://github.com/Zafnok/shuyi-engine/blob/main/tickets/done/2101-fixed-step-timers.md) ([#38](https://github.com/Zafnok/shuyi-engine/pull/38))
- [Draw the scene](https://github.com/Zafnok/shuyi-engine/blob/main/tickets/done/2301-draw-the-scene.md) ([#34](https://github.com/Zafnok/shuyi-engine/pull/34))
- [A \<tool> for \[agents\]](https://github.com/Zafnok/shuyi-engine/blob/main/tickets/done/2501-a--tool--for--agents-.md)

### Changed

- **Breaking:** shuyi-core: `Timer::new`: pass the step as a `Step` ([Fixed-step timers](https://github.com/Zafnok/shuyi-engine/blob/main/tickets/done/2101-fixed-step-timers.md) ([#38](https://github.com/Zafnok/shuyi-engine/pull/38)))
- 2 Sonar fixes
- 1 other pull request

### Fixed

- [Rebind keys at run time](https://github.com/Zafnok/shuyi-engine/blob/main/tickets/done/2402-rebind-keys-at-run-time.md) ([#37](https://github.com/Zafnok/shuyi-engine/pull/37))

### Migration guide

#### A timer takes its step as a Step, not a number.

Since `0.2.0`: `Timer::new(u32)` → `Timer::new(Step)` ([Fixed-step timers](https://github.com/Zafnok/shuyi-engine/blob/main/tickets/done/2101-fixed-step-timers.md)).

Before:

```rust
let t = Timer::new(60);
```

After:

```rust
let t = Timer::new(Step::from_ticks(60));
```

